950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜雨五首 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"昕朝避黄屋，露祷动苍穹。\n野老安知帝，豚蹄赛社公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30526,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜雨五首 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"巫祝呼神去，缁黄送水还。\n若非宿来雨，仙圣亦惭颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30527,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜雨五首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"点点沃枯焦，声声伴寂寥。\n五更初听雨，千载后闻韶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30528,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜雨五首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"箫鼓修雩祭，风雷起古湫。\n虽无豢龙氏，尚有斩蛟侯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30529,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜晴一首","author":"刘克庄","text":"□□尚纷扰，烛龙深伏藏。\n金鸡不能忍，腾出照扶桑。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30530,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"富阳","author":"刘克庄","text":"便著羊裘也不难，山林未有一枝安。\n富春耕种桐江钓，却羡先生别墅宽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30531,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒","author":"刘克庄","text":"